      "message": "Isn\u0027t there also a MultisampleResolveAndStore? I feel like in general if we have a resolve attachment we\u0027ll be using DMSAA and thus what you have is right. But maybe there are cases we want to store as well??\n\nI assume the code is set up so that the caller of beginRenderPass should have already make the load/store decisions for the attachments right? So we could check if they want to store or discard the color attachment and pick the correct Resolve store here.",
