      "writtenOn": "2021-11-23T21:19:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I was actually hoping we wouldn\u0027t need proxies at all for Depth and Stencil things. Especially because the higher level could should really need info on what type of depth stencil we will have (I think??). It just needs to know there will be a stencil and/or there will be a depth.\n\nThus I was wondering if the renderPassDesc should hold Textures instead? Do we currently use the renderpassDesc where we wouldn\u0027t have instantiated Textures yet?",
